      "text": "Candidate break removes routine powered-trolley exposure by hand-carrying B4-B12 consecutively during 0-9, unloading at boundaries 1-9. Keep all twelve identifiers and demand fixed. Calculated continuous inspection starts at 0, processes B9 during 8-10 and finishes B12 at 13. Predictions: nine source unloads, twelve correct sealed releases containing 120 brackets, nine transfer-clerk minutes, thirteen inspection-clerk minutes and peak rack occupancy four."
