      "text": "Closest rival sends trolley loads B4-B7 during 0-3 and B8-B11 during 3-6, then hand-carries B12 during 6-7. Completion-first boundaries predict no unloading wait, twelve correct releases by 13, seven transfer minutes, thirteen inspection minutes, peak rack occupancy five and two consumed allowances. Feasible present probe replays both schedules against boundary rules and records whichever executes in the ledger. Opposing burden predictions are nine versus seven transfer minutes; identities, correct releases, counts, occupied intervals, rack states and charge use test feasibility."
